:''For the enemy, see [[Malevolent Island Cat]].''
'''Brainwashed Fish Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Easter Carnival (Gacha Event)|Easter Carnival]], [[Valentine Gals (Gacha Event)|Valentine Gals]], [[Gals of Summer Sunshine (Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer Sunshine]] and [[Excellent 4 Selection (Gacha Event)|Excellent 4 Selection]] events. It was added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]] grants [[Immune to Toxic|Immunity to Toxic]] and a 50% chance to [[Curse]] [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] enemies for 2 seconds.

